    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space exploration horror RPG. Build your own starship and rover to explore the Belt: its thriving cities, mysterious nano-planets inhabited by monsters lurking in the darkness, and the depths of asteroid mines\u2026 The Belt is full of stories and secrets, guilds and factions, conflicts to solve, and peaceful societies seeking to increase their wealth. Who would you join? The noble Sentinels? or the seducing dark powers? It\u2019s you who decides the path. It\u2019s you who decides the future of the Belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between a top-down shooter (when you\u2019re on a planet\u2019s surface) and a scroll shooter (in space).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore planets on a rover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between planets on a starship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your perfect vehicles by customizing them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A role system deeply integrated into different aspects of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join different guilds and organizations, earn perks for each rank, and build your career.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave enough? Monsters in the darkness are waiting for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limitless open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich world full of rich stories.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space exploration horror RPG. Build your own starship and rover to explore the Belt: its thriving cities, mysterious nano-planets inhabited by monsters lurking in the darkness, and the depths of asteroid mines\u2026 The Belt is full of stories and secrets, guilds and factions, conflicts to solve, and peaceful societies seeking to increase their wealth. Who would you join? The noble Sentinels? or the seducing dark powers? It\u2019s you who decides the path. It\u2019s you who decides the future of the Belt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between a top-down shooter (when you\u2019re on a planet\u2019s surface) and a scroll shooter (in space).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore planets on a rover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between planets on a starship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your perfect vehicles by customizing them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A role system deeply integrated into different aspects of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join different guilds and organizations, earn perks for each rank, and build your career.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave enough? Monsters in the darkness are waiting for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A limitless open world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich world full of rich stories.</p></li></ul>",
